{
    "title": "FillIt-Learn KOREAN with KPOP",
    "description": "Korean lyrics learning game created by K-Pop Idol Community CHOEAEDOL\r\nListen to your favorite K-pop music and fill in the lyrics!\r\n\r\n1. Guess K-pop lyrics and learn Korean language in an easy and fun way!\r\nHelp you learn and memorize Korean words by guessing K-pop lyrics.\r\nListen to K-pop, read and pronounce the lyrics to help you learn Korean language.\r\nEveryone can enjoy \u201cFillit\u201d.\r\nAn easy to play game for anyone interested in K-pop.\r\nSing along to your favorite K-pop songs to learn K-pop lyrics.\r\n\r\n2. Find out my Korean language level among K-pop fans worldwide!\r\nCompete with other K-pop fans to climb the global leaderboards!\r\nCompete with your friends or family for rankings!\r\n\r\n3. Check out the ranking of K-pop artists and songs! Play now to make your bias NO.1!\r\nJust play your favorite song and help your favorite artists or songs to the top.\r\nLearn Korean language while making your favorite artist NO.1.\r\nCheck the ranking of each artist and song in real time.\r\n\r\n4. Play Fillit anytime, anywhere!\r\nIt\u2019s easy to play every day!\r\nPlay Fillit during your breaks, on public transport, before bed, or whenever you have a spare moment.\r\nFillit can also help you to learn Korean if you listen to K-pop a lot.\r\nIf you want to memorize K-pop lyrics, you can play any song in Fillit right now.\r\n\r\n5. Fast new song updates!\r\nWith regular song updates, you can learn the lyrics to the latest K-pop songs faster than anyone else.\r\n\r\nIncludes tons of songs from K-pop artists! \r\nBTS, EXO, SEVENTEEN, STRAY KIDS, ENHYPEN, TREASURE, TXT, TWICE, BLACKPINK, IVE, (G)IDLE, AESPA, NEWJEANS, LESSERAFIM,MONSTA X, ATEEZ, ASTRO, SUPERJUNIOR, BTOB, N.SSIGN, THE BOYZ, ZEROBASEONE, SHINEE, BOYNEXTDOOR, &TEAM, RIIZE, REDVELVET, ITZY, STAYC, ETC\r\n\r\n\r\n* The current version is for beta testing and play data may be initialized without notice.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Korean lyrics learning game created by K-Pop Idol Community CHOEAEDOL<br>Listen to your favorite K-pop music and fill in the lyrics!<br><br>1. Guess K-pop lyrics and learn Korean language in an easy and fun way!<br>Help you learn and memorize Korean words by guessing K-pop lyrics.<br>Listen to K-pop, read and pronounce the lyrics to help you learn Korean language.<br>Everyone can enjoy \u201cFillit\u201d.<br>An easy to play game for anyone interested in K-pop.<br>Sing along to your favorite K-pop songs to learn K-pop lyrics.<br><br>2. Find out my Korean language level among K-pop fans worldwide!<br>Compete with other K-pop fans to climb the global leaderboards!<br>Compete with your friends or family for rankings!<br><br>3. Check out the ranking of K-pop artists and songs! Play now to make your bias NO.1!<br>Just play your favorite song and help your favorite artists or songs to the top.<br>Learn Korean language while making your favorite artist NO.1.<br>Check the ranking of each artist and song in real time.<br><br>4. Play Fillit anytime, anywhere!<br>It\u2019s easy to play every day!<br>Play Fillit during your breaks, on public transport, before bed, or whenever you have a spare moment.<br>Fillit can also help you to learn Korean if you listen to K-pop a lot.<br>If you want to memorize K-pop lyrics, you can play any song in Fillit right now.<br><br>5. Fast new song updates!<br>With regular song updates, you can learn the lyrics to the latest K-pop songs faster than anyone else.<br><br>Includes tons of songs from K-pop artists! <br>BTS, EXO, SEVENTEEN, STRAY KIDS, ENHYPEN, TREASURE, TXT, TWICE, BLACKPINK, IVE, (G)IDLE, AESPA, NEWJEANS, LESSERAFIM,MONSTA X, ATEEZ, ASTRO, SUPERJUNIOR, BTOB, N.SSIGN, THE BOYZ, ZEROBASEONE, SHINEE, BOYNEXTDOOR, &amp;TEAM, RIIZE, REDVELVET, ITZY, STAYC, ETC<br><br><br>* The current version is for beta testing and play data may be initialized without notice.",
